
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#160e20">
<title>NOVYRA | Small Stories. Big Feelings.</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#160e20;color:#f7f0e8;font-family:Georgia,serif}
header{padding:24px 22px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #44334a}
.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#e5c58c}
.logo span{display:block;font:10px Arial;letter-spacing:3px;color:#b8a7b9;margin-top:6px}
.coins{font:12px Arial;color:#e5c58c;border:1px solid #786044;border-radius:30px;padding:10px 13px}
main{max-width:650px;margin:auto;padding:24px 21px 110px}
.eyebrow{font:10px Arial;letter-spacing:3px;color:#c5a46c}
.hero{padding:45px 25px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#35203d,#21152c 65%,#171020);border:1px solid #58415c;border-radius:5px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero:after{content:"✧";position:absolute;right:15px;top:5px;font-size:110px;color:#a17b4b22}
.hero h1{font-size:38px;font-weight:normal;line-height:1.15;margin:18px 0}
.hero p{font:13px Arial;line-height:1.8;color:#c8b8c8;max-width:300px}
.goldline{width:48px;height:2px;background:#d4b274;margin:20px 0}
button{cursor:pointer}
.primary{background:#d8b879;color:#211528;border:0;padding:14px 20px;font:12px Arial;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:15px}
.section{margin-top:36px}
.sectionhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
h2{font-size:21px;font-weight:normal;margin:0}
.muted{font:11px Arial;color:#a999aa}
.categories{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:17px}
.category{height:100px;border:1px solid #55415c;background:#21172b;color:#eadcc7;text-align:left;padding:16px;font:15px Georgia;position:relative}
.category span{display:block;font:10px Arial;color:#a99aab;margin-top:9px}
.category:after{content:"↗";position:absolute;right:13px;bottom:12px;color:#c9a96e}
.empty{margin-top:17px;padding:28px 17px;text-align:center;border:1px dashed #59465c;background:#1d1426}
.empty .symbol{font-size:29px;color:#c9a96e}
.empty p{font:12px Arial;color:#b6a7b7;line-height:1.7}
nav{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:#1d1427;border-top:1px solid #493650;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:13px 3px calc(13px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));z-index:3}
nav button{background:none;border:0;color:#aa9bab;font:10px Arial;padding:4px}
nav button b{display:block;font:19px Arial;margin-bottom:5px}
nav button.active{color:#e3c184}
.page{display:none}
.page.active{display:block}
.page-title{font-size:32px;font-weight:normal;margin:10px 0}
.panel{padding:22px;background:#21172b;border:1px solid #55415c;margin-top:18px}
.panel p{font:13px Arial;color:#b9aabd;line-height:1.8}
.line{border:0;border-top:1px solid #44334a;margin:22px 0}
.secondary{background:none;color:#e3c184;border:1px solid #826a4b;padding:12px 18px;font:11px Arial;letter-spacing:1px}
footer{text-align:center;color:#796b80;font:10px Arial;letter-spacing:2px;padding:25px 0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="top">
<div class="logo">NOVYRA
<span>SMALL STORIES. BIG FEELINGS.</span>
</div>
<div class="coins">◇ <span id="credit">0</span> CREDITS</div>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="page active" id="home">
<div class="hero">
<div class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO NOVYRA</div>
<h1>A world of<br>little escapes.</h1>
<div class="goldline"></div>
<p>Discover a different kind of reading experience. Your next favourite story begins here.</p>
<button class="primary" onclick="go('discover')">EXPLORE NOVYRA ↗</button>
</div>

<div class="section">
<div class="sectionhead">
<h2>Explore your mood</h2>
<span class="muted">YOUR WORLD</span>
</div>
<div class="categories">
<button class="category" onclick="go('discover')">Romance<span>Stories of the heart</span></button>
<button class="category" onclick="go('discover')">Mystery<span>Uncover the unknown</span></button>
<button class="category" onclick="go('discover')">Fantasy<span>Beyond imagination</span></button>
<button class="category" onclick="go('discover')">Drama<span>Feel every moment</span></button>
</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<div class="sectionhead"><h2>Your reading space</h2><span class="muted">01</span></div>
<div class="empty">
<div class="symbol">✧</div>
<h3 style="font-weight:normal">Something wonderful is coming.</h3>
<p>Your reading collection will live here. We're preparing the space for your stories.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="discover">
<div class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR NEXT ESCAPE</div>
<h1 class="page-title">Discover</h1>
<p class="muted">A universe of stories, waiting to be explored.</p>
<div class="categories">
<button class="category">Romance<span>Explore collection</span></button>
<button class="category">Mystery<span>Explore collection</span></button>
<button class="category">Fantasy<span>Explore collection</span></button>
<button class="category">Drama<span>Explore collection</span></button>
</div>
<div class="empty"><div class="symbol">✧</div><p>Story collections will appear here when they're ready.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="library">
<div class="eyebrow">YOUR PERSONAL COLLECTION</div>
<h1 class="page-title">My Library</h1>
<div class="empty"><div class="symbol">◇</div><h3 style="font-weight:normal">Your shelf is waiting.</h3><p>Stories you save and read will be organised here.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="wallet">
<div class="eyebrow">YOUR NOVYRA BALANCE</div>
<h1 class="page-title">My Wallet</h1>
<div class="panel">
<div class="muted">AVAILABLE CREDITS</div>
<div style="font-size:42px;color:#e4c58b;margin:15px 0" id="walletcredits">0</div>
<p>Your credits and rewards will be managed here.</p>
<hr class="line">
<button class="secondary" onclick="alert('Daily Golden Gift will be available in a future version.')">DAILY GOLDEN GIFT</button>
</div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="profile">
<div class="eyebrow">YOUR NOVYRA ACCOUNT</div>
<h1 class="page-title">My Profile</h1>
<div class="panel">
<div style="font-size:28px;color:#d6b578">✧</div>
<h2>Welcome, Reader.</h2>
<p>Your personal reading experience starts here.</p>
<hr class="line">
<h3 style="font-weight:normal">NOVYRA Premium</h3>
<p>Ad-free reading. Monthly bonus credits. Exclusive stories.</p>
<button class="secondary" onclick="alert('Premium membership will be available after account and payment setup.')">DISCOVER PREMIUM</button>
</div>
</section>

<footer>ANOTHER WORLD BETWEEN THE PAGES</footer>
</main>

<nav>
<button class="active" onclick="go('home',this)"><b>⌂</b>Home</button>
<button onclick="go('discover',this)"><b>⌕</b>Discover</button>
<button onclick="go('library',this)"><b>▤</b>Library</button>
<button onclick="go('wallet',this)"><b>◇</b>Wallet</button>
<button onclick="go('profile',this)"><b>○</b>Profile</button>
</nav>

<script>
function go(name,btn){
document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(p=>p.classList.remove('active'));
document.getElementById(name).classList.add('active');
document.querySelectorAll('nav button').forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
if(btn)btn.classList.add('active');
else document.querySelectorAll('nav button')[['home','discover','library','wallet','profile'].indexOf(name)].classList.add('active');
window.scrollTo(0,0);
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
